### Decision flow — manual checks (REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
### Set variables for your env
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1) route_and_run — baseline (needs trip_id for non-planning flows)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/route_and_run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "user_id": "YOUR_USER_UUID",
  "trip_id": "YOUR_TRIP_UUID",
  "message": "简要总结今天行程的风险点"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2) route_and_run — active_trip_summary (injects trip digest into recent_messages)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/route_and_run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "user_id": "YOUR_USER_UUID",
  "trip_id": "YOUR_TRIP_UUID",
  "message": "根据当前行程给建议",
  "conversation_context": {
    "context_type": "active_trip_summary",
    "recent_messages": []
  }
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3) constraints meta (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/route_and_run/constraints-meta

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4) Decision replay — session list (JWT)
# 200: { sessions, items } 数组相同。每项除 session_id / trip_run_id / created_at / status / trip_id 外含：
# list_summary（推荐列表主文案）、trip_display_name、trip_destination、user_query_preview、
# planning_phase、completed_at、status_label_zh
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/decision-replay/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5) Decision replay — sessions filtered by trip
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/decision-replay/sessions?trip_id=YOUR_TRIP_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6) Decision replay — timeline (tripRunId = trip_runs.id from list or DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/decision-replay/timeline/TRIP_RUN_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7) confirm_negotiation — expect 200 with valid payload from route_and_run negotiation
# POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/confirm_negotiation
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "session_id": "...", "alternative_id": "...", "expected_negotiation_hash": "..." }

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8) itinerary revision timeline (public in dev — verify before prod)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/trip/YOUR_TRIP_UUID/itinerary_revision_timeline
